WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.750
(dramatic music)

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.173
- I'm one of the Long Nail Goddesses.

00:00:08.173 --> 00:00:11.023
It's a community of
ladies with long nails.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.654
Long nails have been a part of my life

00:00:13.654 --> 00:00:16.610
practically all my life.

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.319
The First Lady is the pastor's wife.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:22.152
(loud chattering)

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:27.050
Traditionally, first ladies have big hats,

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.700
short nails; and I'm a first lady

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.563
with long nails and fascinators.

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:37.460
Tradition doesn't define me, so why would

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:40.230
I cut my nails for church?

00:00:40.230 --> 00:00:42.550
If I can't come in being who I am,

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.460
what good am I going to do for anybody

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.210
sitting on any one of these rows?

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:49.060
Everybody is somebody, at

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:51.270
First Zion Hill Baptist Church.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:53.280
Long Nail Goddesses feel just

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:55.082
as welcome as anybody else.

00:00:55.082 --> 00:00:58.249
(upbeat violin music)

00:01:07.182 --> 00:01:09.932
(dramatic music)

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:13.684
- Tell her we're leaving to church.

00:01:13.684 --> 00:01:14.703
- We on our way.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.573
- Maria has been doing my
nails for about five years.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.650
Every week I go for four to five hours

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.010
to get my nails done.

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:28.440
- Hi baby, how are you?

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.450
- When she opens the floor, she opens

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.601
her doors for all of us to come together.

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:34.823
That's our community.

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:39.344
- I've been doing nails almost 23 years.

00:01:39.344 --> 00:01:42.833
Since I was young, I already
knew, I was different.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:48.140
It definitely helped me
to identify with my girls.

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:52.980
I came out in the '80s as transgender,

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:55.350
and it was very difficult for me.

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:59.350
Being ostracized by society;

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:01.400
I know what it is to be rejected.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.960
Knowing how that feels, I created

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:08.440
a safe haven for the girls,
and I needed that myself.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:09.450
We are a family.

00:02:09.450 --> 00:02:12.950
(nails clicking together)

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.727
- People ask me questions like,

00:02:18.727 --> 00:02:20.380
"How do you do anything?"

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:21.864
Like I clean my baseboards;

00:02:21.864 --> 00:02:24.560
I clean my oven;

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:26.490
I put contacts in!

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:29.083
They grew, I didn't glue them on.

00:02:29.930 --> 00:02:32.343
They grew, so that's how
I know how to use them.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.784
When we're out in the world,

00:02:36.784 --> 00:02:41.784
people say nasty things, some whisper.

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:43.783
It's so rude.

00:02:44.837 --> 00:02:49.270
It hurts, but I could talk to Maria.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.050
I can vent.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:54.330
She doesn't realize
the power that she has,

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:58.098
with being able to build a
person's spirit with nails.

00:02:58.098 --> 00:03:00.380
And when I leave out of there, it's like

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:04.100
OK, my nails look
beautiful; I feel beautiful;

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:06.463
and I'm revived, I'm charged, let's go.

00:03:09.456 --> 00:03:11.460
- It's just like heaven, you know?

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.110
You laugh, you joke,
we talk to one another

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:16.550
about this and that; and
I love just being here.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:18.160
- People speak different languages,

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:19.940
but we all speak this one language.

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:21.960
And we all live this right here.

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:22.890
- I love these girls.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.984
They're the sisters that I
don't have, I have six brothers.

00:03:24.984 --> 00:03:28.390
And these are the women in my life.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.150
- Our community at the salon,

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:34.730
that's where I go get my
mojo back so to speak.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.430
So, that's what we do when we gather.

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:38.403
We help each other.

00:03:40.670 --> 00:03:43.008
Seeing my Long Nail Goddess sisters

00:03:43.008 --> 00:03:48.008
sit in my pew at church is
the most amazing experience.

00:03:49.836 --> 00:03:54.836
That also lets me know that
beyond our salon walls,

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.550
we support each other.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:01.133
The Long Nail Goddesses,
it's a community of love.

